{"op":"add","path":"/elements/insight-text","value":{"type":"TextBlock","props":{"variant":"body","content":"Net MRR ran from $143,500.00 in January to $224,600.00 in December — a total change of $81,100.00. The OLS monthly slope is 7351.7483 (p = 2.73e-14), indicating a rising trajectory across the year. The waterfall above attributes the Jan–Dec shift to new MRR (72900), expansion MRR (21000), and churn drag (-12800). Plan-level net MRR levels are significantly different across Enterprise, Pro, and Starter (p = 2.12e-22, anova), with a mean spread of $102,225.00. This analysis covers 36 plan × month rows (3 plans × 12 months) with no missing observations."},"children":[]}}}
